# Authors

TicketCheck (grant project **NEXTICK**) is developed by:

- **Lara Raffel**
- **Alexander Mäule**
- **Hauke Klünder**

Funded by the German Federal Ministry of Research, Technology and Space
(BMFTR) through the [Prototype Fund](https://www.prototypefund.de/) programme —
funding measure "Software Sprint" (BAnz 15.11.2024), round 2, June to
November 2026.

## Acknowledgments

- **Nextcloud GmbH and Nextcloud contributors** — the platform and framework
  this app builds on
- **Nextcloud community** — feedback, testing, and translations
- **Prototype Fund / Open Knowledge Foundation Deutschland e. V.** — coaching
  and programme support

